              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Car Wars The Card Game is a commercial card game adaptation of the Car Wars vehicle-combat setting."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Published by Steve Jackson Games, Car Wars The Card Game turns the vehicle-combat theme of Car Wars into a dedicated card-driven game."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Setup",
          "subtitle": "Table, deck, equipment, and deal",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "2-6 players use the table arrangement described for Car Wars The Card Game."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Dedicated Car Wars card deck"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Dedicated Car Wars card deck, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Deal vehicle, weapon, manoeuvre, and event cards from the dedicated deck according to the published rules."
